{{Quote|Ezra, the armor I wear is five hundred years old. I reforged it to my liking, but the battles, the history, the blood all lives within it. And the same goes for every Mandalorian.|Sabine Wren|<ref name="Heroes of Mandalore" />}}
'''Sabine Wren's armor''' was a suit of [[Mandalorian]] [[Mandalorian armor|armor]] worn by the [[Mandalorian warrior]] [[Sabine Wren]]. It was originally forged five hundred [[Standard year|years]] before the [[Mission to Mandalore]], for an [[Unidentified individual (armor)|individual]]. Wren reforged it twice, first to fit her when she inherited it and then to modify it sometime after the [[Liberation of Lothal]]. In addition, she frequently repainted it with various colors and designs as part of her artistic expression.

[[Sabine Wren's modified Nite Owl helmet|Her]] [[Nite Owl helmet]] was a custom design for the Wren clan and was painted [[Color|purple-pink]], which matched her [[armor]]. Before going with Ahsoka, she had painted the eyes of the nite owl design using the same color she used for Ezra Bridger's eyes in a mural she painted.<ref name="Farewell" /> Later, 2 white feather shaped stripes running down the front were added. 

==Description==
She painted it in bright [[color]]s to suit her, repainting it with new color schemes on various occasions. During her time with the [[Spectres]], in the years prior to the Liberation of [[Lothal]], she kept her [[Starbird (symbol)|starbird]] insignia on the breastplate, changing only the design's colors with each repainting.<ref name="The Lost Commanders">{{Rebels|The Lost Commanders}}</ref> In the [[Standard year|years]] after the Liberation, when she mostly stayed on Lothal, she painted a new design on her breastplate to go with new modifications she made, abandoning the starbird insignia in favor of the [[Rebel Alliance starbird]] that she helped create on her right pauldron.<ref name="Farewell">{{Rebels|Family Reunion &ndash; and Farewell}}</ref>

Sabine previously painted a [[dejarik]] board design and the number "5," marking her callsign  "5," on the pauldron,<ref name="The Lost Commanders" /> a detail that remained through several repaintings.<ref name="Steps Into Shadow">''[[Star Wars Rebels: Steps Into Shadow]]''</ref> On her left pauldron, she painted a succession of creatures, including an [[anooba]], an unknown creature, and a [[convor]].<ref name="Spark of Rebellion">''[[Star Wars Rebels: Spark of Rebellion]]''</ref><ref name="The Lost Commanders" /><ref name="Steps Into Shadow" /> By the time she left Lothal five years after the [[Battle of Endor]], she had a [[purrgil]] painted on that pauldron.<ref name="Farewell" /> During her early rebel missions, Sabine did not use many [[Mandalorian]] gadgets. She eventually acquired a [[jetpack]] and a pair of [[Mandalorian vambrace]]s.<ref name="SWECG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref>

